If we are right and this does lead to a de-escalation between the DoW and the industry, we will look like geniuses, and a company that

@mntruell GPT-5 is the best technology for businesses to build on.

more than 5 million businesses are using openai; GPT-5 will be a step-change for them.

amgen, BBVA, oscar, the US federal government, and many more partners are using GPT-5 to do things they couldn't before.

@growing_daniel @GaryMarcus can't tell if he is a troll or just extremely intellectually dishonest.

hundreds of millions of happy users, 5th biggest website in the world, people talking about it being the biggest change to their productivity ever...

we deliver, he keeps ordering us off his lawn.

@paulg we have considered this--we could do it nicely on 100 meters square.

it would be a cool monument.

(we also thought about printing GPT-2 out in books and lining our new office with it!)

@theAnujSaharan get out there and start digging i guess

unless

uh hey twitter, can you help?

@SmokeAwayyy o3, o4-mini are not launching today, they come soon.

today is a new feature.

and it points, i hope, to something very important for the future of how AI will integrate in our lives.

@ladoger no thanks

in addition to building agi this team is on trajectory to build the biggest website in the world from a cold start 2.33 years ago

best team in the world, it's just hard

@elonmusk @OpenAI wrong, as you surely know.

want to come visit the first site already under way?

this is great for the country. i realize what is great for the country isn't always what's optimal for your companies, but in your new role i hope you'll mostly put 🇺🇸 first.

prediction: the o3 arc will go something like:

1. "oh damn it's smarter than me, this changes everything ahhhh"

&lt;ten minutes pass&gt;

2. "so what's for dinner, anyway?"

